      ],
      "source": "https://newenglandparisienne.com/2026/07/06/guide-to-southport-ct/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Southport’s Historic District, listed on the National Register in 1971, preserves the commerce and culture of the early nation era.",
